   "text": "Q09  How do Studio drawings and Reports show and save in a workbench?\nHow does a workbench list a Block's\nstudio/sNN-<topic>/ drawings and its\nreports/qNN_<topic>/ Pages, who may edit each\ndrawing, and how does it keep a person's canvas\nedits safe from a newer build?",
