   "text": "Q12  How do we host the SPACE so others can open it?\nHow should the SPACE-level website (SPACE Home,\nthe Block workbenches, the studio drawings) be\nhosted so colleagues can open it from their own\nmachines: where it runs, how they sign in, what\nthey may see and do, and how it stays in sync with\nthe repository?",
